<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills May 27.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills May 27.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount Treasury bills on May 27, a bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of six-month T-bills was set at 9.0 million hryvnias while 23.0 million hryvnias' worth of nine-month paper will be on offer. The bank will also sell 31.0 million hryvnias of 12-month paper.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +38044 244 9150 ($1 = 1.852 hryvnias)</p>
